        "beat_id": "beat-2",
        "scene_id": "scene-01",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "Cosmic rays constantly bombard the Moon, striking lunar soil and bouncing high-energy neutrons away from hidden hydrogen atoms.",
